{"id":"4336312c6be144dc","group":"58","path":"58/batch05/58-df-zfc-recursion4-c.e.-open-set.md","title":"ZFC Recursion4 C.E. Open Set","display":"df-zfc-recursion4-c.e.-open-set — ZFC Recursion4 C.E. Open Set","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-recursion4-c.e.-open-set","aliases":["58-df-zfc-recursion4-c.e.-open-set"],"display":"df-zfc-recursion4-c.e.-open-set — ZFC Recursion4 C.E. Open Set","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[../batch20/58-df-zfc-recursion3-recursively-enumerable-set.md]]","[[../batch19/58-df-prime-number.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-recursion4-c.e.-open-set"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-recursion4-c.e.-open-set</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-recursion4-c.e.-open-set — ZFC Recursion4 C.E. Open Set"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"618dc6ad8d6c1e22\" href=\"?note=618dc6ad8d6c1e22\" title=\"../batch20/58-df-zfc-recursion3-recursively-enumerable-set.md\">../batch20/58-df-zfc-recursion3-recursively-enumerable-set.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"dad686059f3ca152\" href=\"?note=dad686059f3ca152\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-prime-number.md\">../batch19/58-df-prime-number.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\\in V,\\quad U\\subseteq\\omega^\\omega\">\\(U\\in V,\\quad U\\subseteq\\omega^\\omega\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p:\\omega\\to\\omega\">\\(p:\\omega\\to\\omega\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prime}:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Prime}:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (prime enumeration and prime predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"dad686059f3ca152\" href=\"?note=dad686059f3ca152\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-prime-number.md\">../batch19/58-df-prime-number.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SeqCode}:\\omega^{&lt;\\omega}\\to\\omega\">\\(\\operatorname{SeqCode}:\\omega^{&lt;\\omega}\\to\\omega\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion3RecursivelyEnumerableSet}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion3RecursivelyEnumerableSet}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion4CeOpenSet}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion4CeOpenSet}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}recursion4\\text{-}prime\\text{-}enumeration}\\vdash p:\\omega\\to\\omega\\land p(0)=2\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\left(p(n+1)=\\min\\{q\\in\\omega:p(n)&lt;q\\land\\mathrm{Prime}(q)\\}\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}recursion4\\text{-}prime\\text{-}enumeration}\\vdash p:\\omega\\to\\omega\\land p(0)=2\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\left(p(n+1)=\\min\\{q\\in\\omega:p(n)&lt;q\\land\\mathrm{Prime}(q)\\}\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}recursion4\\text{-}sequence\\text{-}code}\\vdash\\forall s\\in\\omega^{&lt;\\omega}\\;\\left(\\operatorname{SeqCode}(s)=\\prod_{i&lt;\\operatorname{lh}(s)}p(i)^{s(i)+1}\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}recursion4\\text{-}sequence\\text{-}code}\\vdash\\forall s\\in\\omega^{&lt;\\omega}\\;\\left(\\operatorname{SeqCode}(s)=\\prod_{i&lt;\\operatorname{lh}(s)}p(i)^{s(i)+1}\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}recursion4\\text{-}c.e.\\text{-}open\\text{-}set}\\vdash\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion4CeOpenSet}_S(U)\\leftrightarrow\\exists W\\subseteq\\omega^{&lt;\\omega}\\;\\left(\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion3RecursivelyEnumerableSet}_S(\\{\\operatorname{SeqCode}(s):s\\in W\\})\\land U=\\{x\\in\\omega^\\omega:\\exists s\\in W\\;(s\\subseteq x)\\}\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}recursion4\\text{-}c.e.\\text{-}open\\text{-}set}\\vdash\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion4CeOpenSet}_S(U)\\leftrightarrow\\exists W\\subseteq\\omega^{&lt;\\omega}\\;\\left(\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion3RecursivelyEnumerableSet}_S(\\{\\operatorname{SeqCode}(s):s\\in W\\})\\land U=\\{x\\in\\omega^\\omega:\\exists s\\in W\\;(s\\subseteq x)\\}\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>A c.e. set of canonical prime-power sequence codes enumerates the basic cylinders whose union is <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\">\\(U\\)</span>; computability no longer depends on an arbitrary hidden injection.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch20/58-df-zfc-recursion3-recursively-enumerable-set.md","status":"resolved","id":"618dc6ad8d6c1e22",